  "text": "Finnbennach is a white-horned bull of Irish legend. He belonged to the herd of the province of Connacht. The epic Tain Bo Cuailnge tells how Queen Medb married Ailill mac Mata. That union set the stage for a battle between two great bulls. Finnbennach fought the brown bull Donn Cuailnge. Both beasts died in their final clash. In their earlier lives the two bulls were rival swineherds. Their feud carried into their rebirths as beasts. The battle between the bulls closed the great cattle raid.",
